Patch 6009: texture offsets are 31 bits (rc-RE pass 22). NV4097_SET_TEXTURE_OFFSET and the vertex texture offset
carry a 31-bit offset; bit 31 is not an address bit (RPCS3 [RSXTexture.cpp fragment_texture::offset(),
vertex_texture::offset(): & 0x7FFFFFFF]). Tools of Destruction binds its main-memory menu movie planes as 0x82A22900 /
0x82B74100; decoded whole, cellGcmResolveIO found no IO page 0x82A, the fallback wrapped to unwritten memory, and the
menu movie sampled zeros (solid green after patch 6008).
rsx_dispatch.c rsx_dsp_get_texture / rsx_dsp_get_vertex_texture and rsx_commands.c (both texture method paths) mask
the offset; the location still comes from the format word. Test: test_rsx_texture_offset (host, CI). General; upstream
only with the PM's OK.

